{"id":54339,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54339"},"modified":"2026-09-02T18:52:46","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T17:52:46","slug":"sao-silvestre-vila-real-sto-antonio-monte-gordo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-vila-real-sto-antonio-monte-gordo\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Real Sto. Ant\u00f3nio Monte Gordo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Real Sto. Ant\u00f3nio Monte Gordo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Real Sto. Ant\u00f3nio Monte Gordo 2026<\/strong> convida-te a viver uma das noites desportivas mais vibrantes do Algarve, ligando o centro hist\u00f3rico pombalino \u00e0s avenidas mar\u00edtimas de <strong>Monte Gordo<\/strong>. Com um percurso de <strong>10 km<\/strong> r\u00e1pido e plano, homologado sob as diretrizes da World Athletics, a prova \u00e9 ideal para estabeleceres o teu recorde pessoal ou celebrares o final de \u00e9poca com ritmo elevado.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Al\u00e9m da corrida principal, o programa integra uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de cariz solid\u00e1rio \u2014 cujas receitas revertem 50% a favor dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e Castro Marim<\/strong> \u2014 e provas dedicadas aos <strong>escal\u00f5es jovens (Kids)<\/strong>. O evento conta com abastecimentos oficiais, balne\u00e1rios no Complexo Desportivo e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os melhores classificados.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 17:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"displ