y-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovens<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 17:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 4 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de VRSA Monte Gordo 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas a partir das 17h00 junto ao edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal na <strong>Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal<\/strong>, em Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 18h00), a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 18h05) e as provas de <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem<\/strong> para escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 17h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento do kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona junto ao Edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal na sexta-feira (15h00 \u00e0s 20h00) e no s\u00e1bado do evento das 10h00 \u00e0s 17h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem balne\u00e1rios e banhos dispon\u00edveis ap\u00f3s a corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os participantes t\u00eam acesso a balne\u00e1rios e duches no <strong>Complexo Desportivo de VRSA<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de instala\u00e7\u00f5es sanit\u00e1rias port\u00e1teis na Avenida da Rep\u00fablica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A caminhada tem cariz solid\u00e1rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, 50% do valor arrecadado nas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es da caminhada reverte diretamente a favor do corpo de <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e Castro Marim<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Real Sto. Ant\u00f3nio Monte Gordo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Jardim Funcional VRSA e Munic\u00edpio de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de VRSA Monte Gordo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de Dezembro de 2026 , com partidas a partir das 17h00 junto ao edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal na Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal , em Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza a Corrida de 10 km (com partida \u00e0s 18h00), a Caminhada de 5 km (\u00e0s 18h05) e as provas de S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem para escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 17h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde decorre o levantamento do kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona junto ao Edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal na sexta-feira (15h00 \u00e0s 20h00) e no s\u00e1bado do evento das 10h00 \u00e0s 17h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem balne\u00e1rios e banhos dispon\u00edveis ap\u00f3s a corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, os participantes t\u00eam acesso a balne\u00e1rios e duches no Complexo Desportivo de VRSA , al\u00e9m de instala\u00e7\u00f5es sanit\u00e1rias port\u00e1teis na Avenida da Rep\u00fablica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A caminhada tem cariz solid\u00e1rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, 50% do valor arrecadado nas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es da caminhada reverte diretamente a favor do corpo de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e Castro Marim .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":54340,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624,47],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_